  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "gdn_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -334
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Seasons garden\n\nFive L-system plants grow (Trim Path draws each one out, turtle order, as an Integrate climbs to 1 in 9 s), sway in the wind (each is sheared about its root by noise) and go through the year: leaves on every turtle vertex swell in spring, darken in summer, turn and drop in autumn — a particle emitter sheds them, blown by a Wind force — and in winter the branches stand bare while snow falls. The season sets the leaf, sky and ground colours (Gradient lookups) and, through the Seasons subpatch (how much autumn, winter and leaf there is), the two emitters' rates.\n\n• Slider into `season` (0 spring … 4) with the toggle off; toggle on: a year every 48 s.\n• Slider into `wind`.  • Bang: replant (grow again).  • Vary: new plants.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Seasons garden\n\nFive L-system plants grow (Trim Path draws each one out, turtle order, as an Integrate climbs to 1 in 9 s), sway in the wind (each is sheared about its root by noise) and go through the year: leaves on every turtle vertex swell in spring, darken in summer, turn and drop in autumn — a particle emitter sheds them, blown by a Wind force — and in winter the branches stand bare while snow falls. The season sets the leaf, sky and ground colours (Gradient lookups) and, through the Seasons subpatch (how much autumn, winter and leaf there is), the two emitters' rates.\n\n• Slider into `season` (0 spring … 4) with the toggle off; toggle on: a year every 48 s.\n• Slider into `wind`.  • Bang: replant (grow again).  • Vary: new plants.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      }
    },
